        "title": {
          "en": "OpenAI Details Codex Applications for Business and Sales Teams",
          "zh": "OpenAI 阐述 Codex 在商业运营与销售团队中的应用"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "OpenAI has outlined how its Codex model is applied by business operations and sales teams to automate the creation of various internal documents from existing inputs.",
          "zh": "OpenAI 阐述了其 Codex 模型如何被商业运营和销售团队应用于从现有输入中自动创建各种内部文档。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Codex assists business operations teams in generating documents such as initiative briefs, strategy updates, leadership decision packets, and progress updates.",
            "Sales teams leverage Codex to create pipeline briefs, meeting preparation packets, forecast reviews, and account plans.",
            "Codex also supports sales teams in diagnosing stalled deals and producing related documentation."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Codex 协助商业运营团队生成诸如倡议简报、战略更新、领导决策包和进度更新等文档。",
            "销售团队利用 Codex 制作销售渠道简报、会议准备包、预测评审和客户计划。",
            "Codex 还支持销售团队诊断停滞交易并生成相关文档。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "The specified applications of Codex demonstrate AI's direct utility in streamlining administrative and strategic document generation across core business functions. This can potentially increase operational efficiency and reduce manual effort in content creation.",
          "zh": "Codex 的具体应用展示了人工智能在简化核心业务职能中行政和战略文档生成方面的直接效用。这可能提高运营效率并减少内容创建中的人工工作量。"
        },
        "source": "OpenAI News",
        "link": "https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-business-operations-teams-use-codex"
      },
